---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import ContentSection from '../../components/ContentSection.astro';
import LinkCard from '../../components/LinkCard.astro';

const relatedPages = [
  { title: 'MLB Betting Hub', href: '/mlb-betting', description: 'Complete MLB guide' },
  { title: 'Pitching Strategy', href: '/mlb/pitching-strategy', description: 'Pitcher analysis' },
  { title: 'Season Discipline', href: '/mlb/season-discipline', description: 'Long season approach' },
];
---

<Layout
  title="MLB Live Betting Guide"
  description="In-game betting for baseball, pitching changes, leverage situations, and when live wagering might offer opportunities in MLB."
>
  <Hero
    title="MLB Live Betting Guide"
    subtitle="In-Game Baseball Wagering Considerations"
    size="medium"
  />

  <div class="container content-container">
    <article class="page-content">
      <ContentSection>
        <div class="quick-take">
          <h2>Quick Take</h2>
          <p>
            Baseball's discrete play structure—pitch by pitch, at-bat by at-bat—makes live betting granular and data-rich. Pitching changes, bullpen usage, and leverage situations create meaningful in-game price movements. However, MLB live markets are sophisticated, and the perceived opportunity of a struggling starter often arrives too late. Selectivity and pre-planned scenarios are essential.
          </p>
        </div>
      </ContentSection>

      <ContentSection title="What Makes MLB Live Betting Unique?" id="unique">
        <h3>Pitching changes dramatically shift lines</h3>
        <p>
          When a starter exits, the game's complexion changes entirely. Bullpen quality, matchup advantages, and remaining innings all factor into new pricing.
        </p>

        <h3>Discrete play structure</h3>
        <p>
          Unlike continuous sports, baseball stops between every pitch. Live betting can target specific situations, innings, or matchups.
        </p>

        <h3>Long games with many betting windows</h3>
        <p>
          Nine innings (or more) provide numerous opportunities—and numerous chances to make mistakes.
        </p>
      </ContentSection>

      <ContentSection title="What This Means for Bettors" id="what-means">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Plan scenarios before the game:</strong> Know which bullpen matchups you want to target.</li>
          <li><strong>Watch pitch counts:</strong> Anticipate starter exits before they happen.</li>
          <li><strong>Respect market speed:</strong> Algorithms price pitching changes almost instantly.</li>
          <li><strong>Consider totals:</strong> Inning-by-inning totals offer specific targeting.</li>
        </ul>
      </ContentSection>

      <ContentSection title="Key Takeaways" id="takeaways">
        <ul>
          <li>Pitching changes are the primary line-moving events</li>
          <li>Discrete play structure allows specific situation targeting</li>
          <li>Long games provide many opportunities (and pitfalls)</li>
          <li>Pre-plan scenarios rather than betting reactively</li>
        </ul>
      </ContentSection>

      <ContentSection title="Related Resources" id="related">
        <div class="related-grid">
          {relatedPages.map((page) => (
            <LinkCard title={page.title} href={page.href} description={page.description} />
          ))}
        </div>
      </ContentSection>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-content { padding: var(--spacing-3xl) 0; }
  .quick-take { background-color: var(--color-surface); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent); padding: var(--spacing-lg); border-radius: 0 var(--border-radius) var(--border-radius) 0; margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl); }
  .quick-take h2 { font-size: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm); }
  .quick-take p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .related-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--spacing-md); margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) { .related-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
